  "text": "proprium.commemoratio-omnium-fidelium-defunctorum-missa-i-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Commemoration of All the Faithful Departed — Mass I” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "O God, Creator and Redeemer of all the faithful, grant to the souls of Your servants and handmaids the remission of all their sins, that they may obtain by our loving prayers the forgiveness which they have always desired. Who livest and reignest with God the Father in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
